# Base URL of the Teaching Tracker API (func-teaching-tracker) for this build.
# One value per environment — set it in the GitHub Environment (dev/test/prod)
# so each frontend build points at its matching Function App.
#
# Take the value from the Function App Terraform output `function_app_hostnames`
# for the same environment, with an `/api` suffix. For example:
#   dev  -> https://func-teachtracker-dev-xxxxxx.azurewebsites.net/api
#   test -> https://func-teachtracker-test-xxxxxx.azurewebsites.net/api
#   prod -> https://func-teachtracker-prod-xxxxxx.azurewebsites.net/api
#
# Leave empty for local development / tests to run on bundled seed data.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
